# The signing key of the project is a secret and it never enters a repository.
#
# The private key lives in the private configuration of the operator:
#
#   ~/.config/deadzone/publishing/deadzone_ed25519_private.key
#
# The public key is committed, in `publishing/pinned-public-key.txt`, and
# it is the key that the native core of DeadZone pins.
*.key
*.pem
